//! stage: lex
// Malformed numeric literals. Each line has exactly one error.
017 //~ ERROR leading zero
00 //~ ERROR leading zero
0_7 //~ ERROR leading zero
12abc //~ ERROR invalid suffix `abc`
0x1g //~ ERROR invalid suffix `g`
1u0 //~ ERROR invalid integer width
1u01 //~ ERROR invalid integer width
1u129 //~ ERROR invalid integer width
1u200 //~ ERROR widths are 1 to 128
1u65536 //~ ERROR invalid integer width
1u //~ ERROR invalid suffix `u`
0o7f32 //~ ERROR invalid suffix `f32` for a binary or octal literal
1.5u8 //~ ERROR invalid suffix `u8` for float literal
1.5f33 //~ ERROR invalid suffix `f33` for float literal
0x //~ ERROR expected hexadecimal digits after `0x`
0b //~ ERROR expected binary digits after `0b`
0o //~ ERROR expected octal digits after `0o`
0b12 //~ ERROR invalid digit `2` in binary literal
0o8 //~ ERROR invalid digit `8` in octal literal
0XFF //~ ERROR prefixes must be lowercase
0B1 //~ ERROR prefixes must be lowercase
0x_1 //~ ERROR separators
1_ //~ ERROR separators
1__0 //~ ERROR separators
0x1_ //~ ERROR separators
1.5_ //~ ERROR separators
1e //~ ERROR invalid suffix `e`
1e+ //~ ERROR invalid suffix `e`
0x1.8 //~ ERROR require a `p` exponent
1e99999999 //~ ERROR the exponent is larger than 100000
t.01 //~ ERROR leading zero
